WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.844
My portfolio opens by correcting its own
headline.

2
00:00:03.893 --> 00:00:07.387
Then it does the same to a message from
your team.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:13.033
Here is a sample: hotfix steps, the way
they get typed in a chat.

4
00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:16.017
Yellow marks a fact to keep.

5
00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:18.509
A red line is noise to cut.

6
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:21.824
Every fact lands in a first draft.

7
00:00:21.874 --> 00:00:24.513
An AI model writes it from my brief,

8
00:00:24.563 --> 00:00:28.149
and code checks that no name or number was
lost.

9
00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:31.922
In red, the questions the message leaves
open.

10
00:00:31.972 --> 00:00:33.881
Drafting is the quick part.

11
00:00:33.931 --> 00:00:36.326
Getting them answered is the job.

12
00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:40.842
Paste a message of your own at
karandeshmukh.dev.
